## 🗄️ Workspace (Generated Data)

{% if workspace_is_internal %}
Intermediate data (Parquet, DuckDB, plots) is stored in **`_workspace/`** inside this
repository. This directory is gitignored — it is never committed and is fully regenerable.

```
_workspace/
├── output/
│   ├── figures/   ← Generated plots (PNG, PDF)
│   └── tables/    ← Generated Typst tables
└── ...           ← Parquet, DuckDB intermediate files
```

To wipe and rebuild:

```bash
just nuke
just setup
```
{% else %}
Intermediate data (Parquet, DuckDB, plots) is stored **outside the repo** at the path
configured as `WORKSPACE_ROOT` in your `.env` file.

```bash
# Verify your environment is configured correctly
just check-env

# Wipe and rebuild the workspace
just nuke
just setup
```
{% endif %}

